              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Guam and the United States dispute liability for environmental hazards at the Ordot Dump, a site constructed by the Navy in the 1940s and used for waste disposal over several decades."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bfb527815e386b669231b2a817dca41453430433818eadfcdd7888e85dd5d945",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bfb527815e38-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, the case turns on whether \u00a7\u202f113(f)(3)(B) should be read to allow contribution claims only after a party settles a CERCLA\u2011specific liability."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background & Question",
