            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court reversed the Court of Appeals judgment and remanded the case, holding that \u00a7\u202f113(f)(3)(B) permits contribution only after a party settles a CERCLA\u2011specific liability."
      }
