            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked whether the United States\u2019 position improperly imports the term \u201cunder CERCLA\u201d into Section\u202f113 while the case is brought under Section\u202f107."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bfb527815e386b669231b2a817dca41453430433818eadfcdd7888e85dd5d945",
