            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor questioned whether the Court had resolved the claims rather than the liability."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bfb527815e386b669231b2a817dca41453430433818eadfcdd7888e85dd5d945",
