            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked for clarification on the preemptive effect of the government\u2019s position for state contribution laws."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bfb527815e386b669231b2a817dca41453430433818eadfcdd7888e85dd5d945",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bfb527815e38-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, justice Thomas inquired whether a CERCLA recovery could be sought for penalties under other environmental provisions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bfb527815e386b669231b2a817dca41453430433818eadfcdd7888e85dd5d945",
            "evidence_ids": [
