              "pages": {
                "end": 46,
                "start": 46
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The United States argues that remedial measures taken under other environmental statutes can be considered CERCLA \u201cresponse actions.\u201d"
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "9d333f89c250927d1987bbf1c9318ed8c17199d88cf09447fb6882bee30910fa",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-9d333f89c250-0001-0000"
