              "pages": {
                "end": 12,
                "start": 12
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The United States contends that \u00a7\u202f113(f)(3)(B) already permits contribution after any civil action under \u00a7\u00a7\u202f106 and\u202f107, making an additional reading redundant."
        }
